# Footprint 足迹

**Travel Records + Trip Planning + Travel Guide Q&A.**

Light up cities you have visited on the map, log expenses with a single sentence.
Tell the AI assistant "Plan 4 days in Hangzhou from Shanghai with a budget of ¥3000",
and it generates an **executable** timeline itinerary — which train to take and when,
where to eat, where to stay, itemized costs, and over-budget warnings.

</div>

## Author

**Qing (青)** — brand and UI design, footprint map and city lighting, itinerary planning with
preference-aware filtering, knowledge-base retrieval boost, web-search fallback and automated tests.

